# Copper ions lift Daniell-cell voltage
register lv3
add v1 water 200mL
add v1 ZnSO4 0.01mol
add v1 Zn 0.05mol
new
add v2 water 200mL
add v2 CuSO4 0.0005mol
add v2 Cu 0.05mol
cell v1 v2
new
add v3 water 200mL
add v3 ZnSO4 0.01mol
add v3 Zn 0.05mol
new
add v4 water 200mL
add v4 CuSO4 0.001mol
add v4 Cu 0.05mol
cell v3 v4
new
add v5 water 200mL
add v5 ZnSO4 0.01mol
add v5 Zn 0.05mol
new
add v6 water 200mL
add v6 CuSO4 0.005mol
add v6 Cu 0.05mol
cell v5 v6
new
add v7 water 200mL
add v7 ZnSO4 0.01mol
add v7 Zn 0.05mol
new
add v8 water 200mL
add v8 CuSO4 0.01mol
add v8 Cu 0.05mol
cell v7 v8
# These are equilibrium open-circuit voltages, not delivered-current tests.
